{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/c5314ec22ffe4a486942a6a0d2f0b28d.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1414 height=630 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the legendary shitgame series, here comes the next one: <i>Moonsteel</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo first-person horror game where you roam a vast forest infested with trolls out for your blood. Your one and only goal: survive and find the legendary sword hidden somewhere in the forest (its location changes every game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is especially long\u2026 and boring. The atmosphere is decent, but overall, it's a poor, slightly rushed experience with minimal customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So why am I releasing it ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I know some of you are real tryhards who fear no grind and will do whatever it takes to find that sword and beat the game \u2014 no matter how long it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're still reading, here\u2019s a more detailed description:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive map</strong><br>Wander through a dark and creepy forest with no landmarks, stretching across kilometers. You\u2019ll need to run \u2014 but wisely \u2014 manage your stamina, and above all, avoid crossing paths with the roaming monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/cd36ba96288936f5be009b27eb1bf172.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dangerous trio</strong><br>Three gigantic trolls patrol the forest and will attack as soon as they spot you. Crouch in time\u2026 or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/f112fc8b6e00aaf62cbcaa2528309d95.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A legendary sword</strong><br>A strange sound echoes from the blade. Find it as fast as you can to end the game. Patience and perseverance are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/extras/ef288e4ec22445abb620f37f3b115d27.avif?t=1756124181\" width=1600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About the game</strong><br>This is a boring, poorly made indie horror game. You\u2019ve been warned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck !</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897640?t=1756124181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897640?t=1756124181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/7847e4e521b9f2c2ce5fe7d51f3c9713aa765d4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756124181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897640/7847e4e521b9f2c2ce5fe7d51f3c9713aa765d4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756124181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_